 Riven\nand the burning village environment.\n\nThe final moment of this scene must naturally lead into\nthe established image of Riven lying on the ground\nwith her sword lying intact in front of her.\n\n\n=== TECHNICAL ===\n\n16:9 cinematic live-action dark fantasy.\n\nLate sunset moving into a darker smoky atmosphere.\n\nGrounded realistic movement.\n\nNatural cinematic camera movement.\n\nDense smoke, firelight, drifting ash and embers.\n\nMysterious and restrained.\n\nNo clear monster reveal.\n\nNo combat sequence.\n\nNo subtitles.\n\nNo background music.\n\n\n=== SCENE ===\n\nContinue with Riven moving deeper into the burning village.\n\nShe is searching for her father.\n\nThe streets become quieter and more empty.\n\nBurning buildings remain around her,\nbut the chaos feels increasingly distant.\n\nRiven walks carefully through thick smoke and debris.\n\nShe looks between the ruined houses.\n\nShe calls:\n\n\"Father!\"\n\n\nNo answer.\n\n\nRiven continues forward.\n\nShe notices strange dark marks\nacross damaged wood and parts of the ground.\n\nThey do not look like ordinary fire damage.\n\nRiven briefly examines them,\nbut she does not understand what caused them.\n\n\nThen she hears a faint sound somewhere ahead.\n\nRiven immediately looks toward it.\n\nShe thinks it may be her father.\n\n\nRiven calls more quietly:\n\n\"Father?\"\n\n\nShe follows the sound deeper into the smoke.\n\n\nThrough the smoke ahead,\nsomething dark briefly moves between the ruined buildings.\n\nRiven stops.\n\nShe tries to see through the smoke.\n\n\nFor only a brief moment,\na vague dark silhouette can be seen far ahead.\n\nIts identity and shape are impossible to understand.\n\nDo not clearly reveal a creature.\n\nDo not show a readable face.\n\nDo not explain what it is.\n\n\nRiven takes a cautious step forward.\n\n\nThe silhouette disappears into the smoke.\n\n\nRiven looks around.\n\nNothing.\n\n\nA short silence.\n\n\nThen Riven suddenly senses movement from another direction.\n\nShe turns—\n\nA powerful unseen impact strikes her before she can react.\n\n\nDo not clearly show what attacks her.\n\n\nRiven is violently knocked off balance\nand thrown onto the ground.\n\n\nHer intact sword slips from her hand\nand slides across the dirt away from her.\n\n\nRiven hits the ground hard.\n\nShe is stunned but still conscious.\n\n\nEnd with the sword lying intact on the ground\nseveral feet in front of Riven.\n\nRiven lies behind it,\ntrying to recover from the impact.\n\n\nThe attacker remains completely unseen.\n\n\nCUT.、16:9", "ref_objects": [{"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/5ba83cdcc6d54bc7b6d40e3b3e279b94.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}, {"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/e91cd3f3d27245f1af4153ba54ffa139.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}, {"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/420f870172f646b981e41131468cbfd9.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}], "result": {"object_type": 2, "video": {"vid": "v186a3gm000cdase43nog65okca2e4i0", "download_url": "http://v16-dola.dola.com/98a44add88c1bcdebd177b9c823fa24e/7d84e545/video/tos/mya/tos-mya-ve-50851/o0FIhE4quxvOFJOgExiOGN4BY24fIShfqRIwQD/", "duration": 30.079999923706055, "video_type": "mp4", "video_model": {"status": 10, "message": "success", "enable_ssl": true, "auto_definition": "360p", "enable_adaptive": false, "video_id": "v186a3gm000cdase43nog65okca2e4i0", "video_duration": 30.08, "media_type": "video", "url_expire": 2105861445, "fallback_api": "https://vod-urls-mya.byteintlapi.com/video/fplay/1/e8b3792dbb35038077142c584bfd5984/v186a3gm000cdase43nog65okca2e4i0", "video_list": {"video_1": {"definition": "1080p", "quality": "normal", "vtype": "mp4", "vwidth": 1280, "vheight": 720, "bitrate": 687443, "real_bitrate": 687443, "fps": 24, "codec_type": "bytevc1", "size": 2584787, "main_url": "", "backup_url_1": "", "file_id": "93cb4a53403f49aa8d44a004087f07eb", "quality_type": 1, "encrypt